2 CONT * Wu Haixia 伍海霞. “Qianlun Shishuo xinyu zhong Wang Huizhi zhi xingxiang he Wei Jin fengdu” 淺論《世說新語》中王徽之形象和魏晉風度. ''Xiandai yuwen'' (''Wenxue yanjiu ban'') (2012: 2): 13–14.
2 CONT
