2 CONT * Chen Chuanxi 陳傳席, ed. Liuchao hualun yanjiu 六朝畫論研究, 143–78. Taipei: taiwan xuesheng shuju, 1991. 
2 CONT * Okamura shigeru 岡村繁. Yu Weigang 俞慰剛, trans. Lidai minghua ji yizhu 歷代名畫記譯注, 328–32. Gangcun Fan quanji 岡村繁全集, Vol. 6. Shanghai: Shanghai guji chubanshe, 2002.
2 CONT
