2 CONT * Chen Chuanxi 陳傳席, ed. Liuchao hualun yanjiu 六朝畫論研究, 165–77. Taipei: Taiwan xuesheng shuju, 1991.
2 CONT * Cao Daoheng and Shen Yucheng, Zhonggu wenxue shiliao congkao, 282, 322. 
2 CONT * Tian Li 田力. “Chongjue Wang Wei ‘Xu hua' de meixue jiazhi” 重掘王微《敘畫》的美學價值. Yishu tansuo 18.4 (2004): 39–40. 
2 CONT * Bush, Susan. “The Essay on Painting by Wang Wei 王微 (415–453) in Context.” in Chinese Aesthetics: The Ordering of Literature, the Arts, and the Universe in the Six Dynasties, ed. Zong-qi Cai, 60–80. Honolulu: University of Hawaii
2 CONC  Press, 2004.
