1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Notes about Fènggé's longevity:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Translation by his 27th Grandson Kenneth Hong: Fènggé was born in [1242] the second year of the Chunyou (淳祐 Chúnyòu, 1241-1252) Era of the Southern Song Dynasty and died [1369] in the second year of of the Hongwu Era [洪武, Hóngwǔ 1
2 CONC 368–1398] of the Ming Dynasty. He lived 128 years (寿128岁). He was married to née Xie (謝氏), their son was Huì'ān 惠蓭. He resided separately [from other branches of the family] in Shi Tou, Xin Hui county (分居新会石头).
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=178&cid=13
