2 NOTE Ken,
3 CONT
3 CONT OK, I shall do it for you based upon what you had enter in Geni.com.  On seeing the first draft, things can easily be changed to suit. Consider the photos you want to add; besides those of individual profiles.
3 CONT
3 CONT Philip
2 NOTE Philip,
3 CONT I was planning to fill in the chart to my family, but if you have an easy way to do that, I'd be very thankful.
3 CONT Cheers,
3 CONT Ken
2 NOTE Hi Ken,
3 CONT
3 CONT OK I shall send you the excel file when I get back home tonight. I am out having meetings the whole day. Do you want me to fill up the file down to your family first? I could easily do that for you. The form of the chart as you sa
3 CONC w is for the Forum. 
3 CONT
3 CONT I shall include the adoption side as well.
3 CONT
3 CONT Philip
